      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village’s Italianate bandstand, built in 1879, sits in the center of Main Street and hosts summer concerts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        5,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bellville%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Bellville’s historic mill, now a gift shop, draws visitors and preserves the town’s milling heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://destinationmansfield.com/blog/a-day-in-bellville/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Bellville-Jefferson Township Historical Society Museum preserves local history and is housed in a former school building.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://bellvilleohiohisto.wixsite.com/homepage",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A 19th‑century post office opened in 1824, making Bellville one of the first Ohio towns with its own mail service.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26
